d their family to find a new home<br></li><li> Explore the prehistoric era and meet peculiar characters<br></li><li> Stop the bad guys from ruining tribe's happiness<br></li><li> Dozens of exciting levels to master and hundreds of quests<br></li><li> Find hidden treasures and win achievements<br></li><li> 3 difficulty modes: relaxed, timed and extreme<br></li><li> Step-by-step tutorials for beginners<ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul></li></ul>",
